    # MC @ surprised "THIS IS MADNESS! ALL OF YOU MUST GO HOME! BOARD UP YOUR WINDOWS AND DOORS AT ONCE!"
    MC @ surprised "BU DELİLİK! HEPİNİZ EVE GİTMELİSİNİZ! PENCERELERİNİZİ VE KAPILARINIZI HEMEN TAHTALAYIN!"

