    # "At last, shambling within range of the crowd and fully circling the people, the guards began to shake violently in a spasm."
    "Nihayet, kalabalığın menziline kadar sendeleyip insanları tamamen daire içine alan muhafızlar spazm halinde şiddetle sarsılmaya başladılar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:149
