    # ALCOTT @ talk "Marion doesn't need to be {i}right{/i}—she only needs to convince the lords that you are too great a threat to keep alive."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Marion'un {i}haklı{/i} olması gerekmiyor—sadece lordları, seni hayatta tutulamayacak kadar büyük bir tehdit olduğuna ikna etmesi gerekiyor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2296
translate tr qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_403fc54c:

    # MC @ talk "...So, will you speak on my behalf?"
    MC @ talk "...Peki, benim lehime konuşacak mısın?"

